Sat Oct 31 14:42:41 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Build the pty helper from source instead of shipping upstream's
  prebuilt binaries
  * %build compiles packages/process-daemon 0.4.0 (new Source20)
    with `cargo build --release --offline --locked` against its
    locked cargo closure (new Source21, from the cargo_vendor
    service), statically linking Ghostty libghostty-vt built with
    zig 0.16.0 from Source22, and exports it as OPENCODE_PTY_BIN
    for the CLI build to embed (version "local", sha256 recorded)
