    also restored a musl x86_64 PTY entry in its lockfile, which
    this glibc-only build never resolves
  * The CLI retries a managed service bind after a conflict, keeps
    a failed background service visible and waits for shutdown
    before restarting it; the client survives a protocol-only
    reconnect
  * Gemini, Mistral, Cohere and Anthropic system messages are no
    longer dropped or reordered; the server answers 404 for a
    missing location folder
  * The TUI shows read ranges after file paths, keeps its
    transcript stable when history is prepended, gates terminals on
    server PTY support and accepts plugin keymaps during setup
  * Many more fixes and improvements; the full list is upstream's
    v2.0.22..v2.0.23 commit range, which publishes no release notes
